{
  "ko_slug": "chrome-및-firefox에서-nofollow-링크를-확인하는-방법",
  "source_hash": "6ee162759f5afc7b469639aba575f4faea3bcebedbf0fb478eb0d86265c161e9",
  "en": {
    "slug": "check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox",
    "title": "How to check nofollow links in Chrome and Firefox",
    "excerpt": "Check nofollow attributes using browser extensions, page source or Chrome's element inspector.",
    "content": "<div class=\"fusion-image-element \" style=\"text-align:center;--awb-margin-bottom:30px;--awb-caption-title-font-family:var(--h2_typography-font-family);--awb-caption-title-font-weight:var(--h2_typography-font-weight);--awb-caption-title-font-style:var(--h2_typography-font-style);--awb-caption-title-size:var(--h2_typography-font-size);--awb-caption-title-transform:var(--h2_typography-text-transform);--awb-caption-title-line-height:var(--h2_typography-line-height);--awb-caption-title-letter-spacing:var(--h2_typography-letter-spacing);\"><span class=\" fusion-imageframe imageframe-none imageframe-2 hover-type-none\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" title=\"How to check nofollow links in Chrome and Firefox\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?fit=1200%2C628&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-src=\"https://j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png\" alt class=\"lazyload img-responsive wp-image-14152\" srcset=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271200%27%20height%3D%27628%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201200%20628%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271200%27%20height%3D%27628%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=200%2C105&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=300%2C157&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=400%2C209&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=600%2C314&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=700%2C366&amp;ssl=1 700w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=768%2C402&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=800%2C419&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=1024%2C536&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?fit=1200%2C628&amp;ssl=1 1200w\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-orig-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 800px\"></span></div><div class=\"fusion-content-tb fusion-content-tb-1\" style=\"--awb-margin-bottom:40px;\"><p>When building<a href=\"/en/insights/six-advanced-link-building-strategies-to-outperform-competitors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> links to a website (link building),</a> it is important to check that links do not have a nofollow attribute.</p>\n<p> For Google and other search engines, nofollow means the link does not improve rankings or pass <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PageRank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PageRank</a>.</p>\n<p> The nofollow attribute looks like this.</p>\n<p>&lt;a href=”[link]” rel=”nofollow” &gt; [anchor]&lt;/a&gt;</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>Firefox and Chrome extensions and plugins for checking nofollow links</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/search/nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Nofollow Chrome extension</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/search/?q=nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Nofollow Mozilla Firefox plugin</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2> Checking nofollow links manually<br>\n<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload alignnone size-full wp-image-14153\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=1240%2C589&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-src=\"https://j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1240\" height=\"589\" srcset=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271936%27%20height%3D%27919%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201936%20919%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271936%27%20height%3D%27919%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=200%2C95&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=300%2C142&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=400%2C190&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=600%2C285&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=700%2C332&amp;ssl=1 700w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=768%2C365&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=800%2C380&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=1024%2C486&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=1200%2C570&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=1536%2C729&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?fit=1936%2C919&amp;ssl=1 1936w\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-orig-sizes=\"(max-width: 1240px) 100vw, 1240px\"></h2>\n<ol>\n<li> Visit the page containing the link you want to check.</li>\n<li> View page source, usually with CTLR+U, or through the browser menu.</li>\n<li> Search (CTRL+F) for the link you want to check.</li>\n<li> Look for the <strong>rel=”nofollow”</strong> attribute in the link.</li>\n</ol>\n<p> Google Chrome offers a simple manual method: right-click the link -&gt; Inspect element.<br>\nRemember that a webmaster can add nofollow to your link later.</p>\n</div>",
    "meta_title": "How to check nofollow links in Chrome and Firefox",
    "meta_description": "Check nofollow attributes using browser extensions, page source or Chrome's element inspector."
  },
  "ja": {
    "slug": "check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox",
    "title": "Chrome・Firefoxでnofollowを確認",
    "excerpt": "拡張機能、ページソース、Chromeの要素検証でnofollow属性を確認する方法です。",
    "content": "<div class=\"fusion-image-element \" style=\"text-align:center;--awb-margin-bottom:30px;--awb-caption-title-font-family:var(--h2_typography-font-family);--awb-caption-title-font-weight:var(--h2_typography-font-weight);--awb-caption-title-font-style:var(--h2_typography-font-style);--awb-caption-title-size:var(--h2_typography-font-size);--awb-caption-title-transform:var(--h2_typography-text-transform);--awb-caption-title-line-height:var(--h2_typography-line-height);--awb-caption-title-letter-spacing:var(--h2_typography-letter-spacing);\"><span class=\" fusion-imageframe imageframe-none imageframe-2 hover-type-none\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" title=\"Chrome・Firefoxでnofollowを確認\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?fit=1200%2C628&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-src=\"https://j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png\" alt class=\"lazyload img-responsive wp-image-14152\" srcset=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271200%27%20height%3D%27628%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201200%20628%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271200%27%20height%3D%27628%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=200%2C105&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=300%2C157&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=400%2C209&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=600%2C314&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=700%2C366&amp;ssl=1 700w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=768%2C402&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=800%2C419&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?resize=1024%2C536&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/how-to-check-nofollow-links-in-chrome-and-firefox.png?fit=1200%2C628&amp;ssl=1 1200w\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-orig-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 800px\"></span></div><div class=\"fusion-content-tb fusion-content-tb-1\" style=\"--awb-margin-bottom:40px;\"><p>サイトへの<a href=\"/ja/insights/six-advanced-link-building-strategies-to-outperform-competitors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> リンク構築を行う際、</a> nofollow属性がないか確認することが重要です。</p>\n<p>Googleなどの検索エンジンでは、順位の改善や <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PageRank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PageRank</a>の受け渡しをしないことを意味します。</p>\n<p>属性は次の形式です。</p>\n<p>&lt;a href=”[リンク]” rel=”nofollow” &gt; [アンカー]&lt;/a&gt;</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>確認用のFirefox・Chrome拡張機能</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/search/nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nofollow Chrome拡張機能</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/search/?q=nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nofollow Mozilla Firefoxプラグイン</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>手動で確認する方法<br>\n<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload alignnone size-full wp-image-14153\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=1240%2C589&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-src=\"https://j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1240\" height=\"589\" srcset=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%271936%27%20height%3D%27919%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%201936%20919%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%271936%27%20height%3D%27919%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=200%2C95&amp;ssl=1 200w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=300%2C142&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=400%2C190&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=600%2C285&amp;ssl=1 600w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=700%2C332&amp;ssl=1 700w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=768%2C365&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=800%2C380&amp;ssl=1 800w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=1024%2C486&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=1200%2C570&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?resize=1536%2C729&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/j-curve.co.kr/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Inspect.png?fit=1936%2C919&amp;ssl=1 1936w\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-orig-sizes=\"(max-width: 1240px) 100vw, 1240px\"></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>対象リンクがあるページを開きます。</li>\n<li>通常はCTLR+U、またはメニューからページソースを開きます。</li>\n<li>CTRL+Fで対象リンクを検索します。</li>\n<li>リンクの <strong>rel=”nofollow”</strong> 属性を確認します。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Chromeでは、リンクを右クリック -&gt; 要素を検証、という簡単な方法もあります。<br>\n後で管理者がnofollowを追加する場合もあることを忘れないでください。</p>\n</div>",
    "meta_title": "Chrome・Firefoxでnofollowを確認",
    "meta_description": "拡張機能、ページソース、Chromeの要素検証でnofollow属性を確認する方法です。"
  }
}
